These codes here are demonstrating object-oriented programming (OOP) concepts such as:

1. Encapsulation & Access Modifiers (Private members in inheritance)
2. Class Design & Inheritance (Employee & Manager classes)
3. Multilevel Inheritance & Polymorphism (University management system)
4. Abstraction & Method Overriding (Vehicle & Car classes)
5. Runtime Polymorphism (Restaurant management system with different chefs)
